***Martians*** is a simulated astronaut survival scenario on Mars, centered on environmental hazards, habitat operations, and emergency resource management.

Through its 3D environment, monitoring interfaces, and survival decisions, it shows why protecting life-support systems and conserving energy matters during a Martian dust storm.

**Framework Used**\
This code is using vite

**Install dependencies**\
npm install

**Run the project**\
npm run dev

**Build the project**\
npm run build

**Preview the project**\
npm run preview